# Docker build context filters (ops / ISSUE-0010).
# Keeps secrets and local state out of image build contexts. The Dockerfiles in
# infra/docker COPY only apps/core and apps/integration; everything else is noise.

.git/
.gitignore
**/.env
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info/
backups/
infra/backups/
*.log
